#: ../../source/classes/class_fmoddsp.rst:23 c288917a2e844cd0ada2f2dc12c213b2
msgid ""
"FmodDSP wraps the FMOD Core API's DSP (Digital Signal Processing) unit. It provides access to "
"various audio effects and processing units such as oscillators, filters, reverb, delay, and more."
" DSP units can be connected together to form complex audio processing chains."
msgstr "FmodDSP 封装 FMOD Core API 的 DSP（数字信号处理）单元，可用于振荡器、滤波、混响、延迟等音频处理。多个 DSP 单元可以连接成音频处理链。"

