#: ../../source/classes/class_fmoddsp.rst:1177 117e5eea9f39483699ace32b4ee5df45
msgid ""
"Assigns the custom DSP ``create`` callback. The callable receives no arguments and may return an "
"FMOD result code. Assigning it does not recreate the DSP. Notifications from other threads are "
"deferred to the main thread; their return values cannot affect the completed FMOD call. Pass an "
"empty :ref:`Callable<class_Callable>` to clear it."
msgstr ""
"设置自定义 DSP 的     ``create``     回调。不接收参数，可返回 FMOD 结果码。设置回调不会重新创建 "
"DSP。来自其他线程的通知会延迟到主线程执行，其返回值无法影响已经完成的 FMOD 调用。传入空     :ref:`Callable<class_Callable>`     可清除回调。"

