#: ../../source/classes/class_fmoddsp.rst:1249 f4858d439d40470eac5314d4812b876b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Sets a callback ``func(samples: PackedFloat32Array, frames: int, input_channels: int, "
"output_channels: int) -> Dictionary``. Samples are interleaved; generators receive an empty input"
" array. Return ``{\"output\": samples}``. Short output is padded with zeros. Optional "
"``cooldown`` (sample frames), ``bypass``, and ``silence`` control FMOD 2.04 DSP state. Callbacks "
"execute only when FMOD mixes on the Godot main thread, such as "
":ref:`FmodSystem.FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_NOSOUND_NRT<class_FmodSystem_constant_FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_NOSOUND_NRT>`;"
" other threads use passthrough for filters and zero output for generators."
msgstr ""
"设置回调     ``func(samples: PackedFloat32Array, frames: int, input_channels: int, output_channels: "
"int) -> Dictionary``    。采样数据按声道交错排列，生成器接收空输入数组。通过     ``{\"output\": samples}``     "
"返回输出，长度不足的部分补零。可选的     ``cooldown``    （采样帧数）、    ``bypass``     和     ``silence``     用于控制 FMOD "
"2.04 的 DSP 状态。只有 FMOD 在 Godot 主线程混音时才会执行回调，例如使用     "
":ref:`FmodSystem.FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_NOSOUND_NRT<class_FmodSystem_constant_FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_NOSOUND_NRT>`"
"    。其他线程中，滤波器直接传递输入，生成器输出零。"

